  "body": [
    "Flex your financial muscle. We’ll spot you with helpful articles, tips, and stories from people like you who are exercising their financial know-how in making every dollar go further.",
    "Become a savvy shopper with tips on how to use Buy Now, Pay Later responsibly, sending virtual gift cards, and everything in between.",
    "From sending money safely across town or across the globe to getting paid to supporting your fave charities, here’s what to know.1",
    "Managing your finances doesn’t have to be hard. Learn how to budget, do your banking on the go, dip into crypto, and more.2",
    "Make shopping online and in store simple. Watch these videos to see how."
